Clearcap
========
Design: colours, spacing, the audio-bar visualizer, the model-picker cards (speed / accuracy / "best for") and
the compact settings layout follow VoiceFlow (MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 VoiceFlow) and OpenWhispr
(MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 OpenWhispr Team). The Dictionary screen follows OpenWhispr's.

Logic ported to Kotlin from OpenWhispr (MIT): dictionary bulk import, the dictionary echo filter and the
correction learner (app/src/main/java/com/clearcap/text/WordBank.kt). Tests reuse OpenWhispr's own cases.

Runtime libraries and models (downloaded by the user, not bundled):
- sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0), k2-fsa.
- Streaming Zipformer English model (Apache-2.0).
- NVIDIA Parakeet 110M (CC-BY-4.0).
- OpenAI Whisper (MIT).
- Silero VAD (MIT).
